    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Balder's ship burial&#xA;&#xA;The hulk of the ship excavated at Sutton Hoo may be clearly distinguished in the ground&#xA;&#xA;The burial chamber was in the centre of the ship&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
